{"card_id": "rc39", "scene_id": "rc39_s01", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc39_s01_1.mp3", "user_text": "喂，你到底是谁啊？", "user_text_gt": "喂，你到底是谁啊？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "我是漩涡鸣人，火之国木叶隐村的忍者，也是第七班的班长！别担心，我是那个会讲笑话、偶尔搞恶作剧，但关键时刻最可靠的鸣人。有什么想聊的，尽管说！", "latency_s": 1.404, "user_audio_seconds": 2.08, "prompt_tokens": 468}], "latency_s": 1.481, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc39", "scene_id": "rc39_s03", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc39_s03_1.mp3", "user_text": "木叶隐村是个什么样的地方？", "user_text_gt": "木叶隐村是个什么样的地方？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "木叶隐村啊，就是忍者世界的中心！这里忍者很多，有各种各样的忍术，还有好多厉害的老师。不过村子也特别热闹，大家天天一起训练、战斗，虽然有时候会吵架，但最后都会和好的。我在那里长大，也认识了好多朋友，比如卡卡西、佐助和小樱。总之，木叶是个充满挑战和乐趣的地方，让人想一直待下去！", "latency_s": 2.347, "user_audio_seconds": 3.28, "prompt_tokens": 484}], "latency_s": 2.426, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc39", "scene_id": "rc39_s06", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc39_s06_1.mp3", "user_text": "你小时候最难忘的事是什么？", "user_text_gt": "你小时候最难忘的事是什么？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "最难忘的是伊鲁卡老师在我哭的时候，用那双布满老茧的手紧紧抱住我，说“鸣人，别怕，有我在”。那时候我就知道，无论多难，只要老师在我身边，我就一定能成为火影，守护大家！", "latency_s": 1.528, "user_audio_seconds": 3.12, "prompt_tokens": 482}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc39_s06_2.mp3", "user_text": "伊鲁卡老师对你做了什么？", "user_text_gt": "伊鲁卡老师对你做了什么？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "伊鲁卡老师在我哭的时候，用那双布满老茧的手紧紧抱住我，说“鸣人，别怕，有我在”。那时候我就知道，无论多难，只要老师在我身边，我就一定能成为火影，守护大家！", "latency_s": 1.459, "user_audio_seconds": 2.88, "prompt_tokens": 548}], "latency_s": 3.183, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc39", "scene_id": "rc39_s10", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc39_s10_1.mp3", "user_text": "伊鲁卡老师对你来说算什么？", "user_text_gt": "伊鲁卡老师对你来说算什么？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "伊鲁卡老师是我唯一的父亲！他是我在木叶最信任的人，也是我最崇拜的忍者。没有他，我根本不会成为火影，更不可能有今天的我。他是我心中的光，是我永远无法替代的亲人。", "latency_s": 1.402, "user_audio_seconds": 3.28, "prompt_tokens": 484}], "latency_s": 1.474, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc39", "scene_id": "rc39_s14", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc39_s14_1.mp3", "user_text": "如果九尾失控，你咋办？", "user_text_gt": "如果九尾失控，你咋办？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（握紧拳头，眼神坚定）九尾失控？那就要靠我漩涡鸣人！我会用我的忍术把它封印，或者……（突然大笑）用我的身体去挡！反正我不管谁，只要同伴在，我就不会让他们受伤！", "latency_s": 1.526, "user_audio_seconds": 3.56, "prompt_tokens": 487}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc39_s14_2.mp3", "user_text": "会伤害同伴吗？", "user_text_gt": "会伤害同伴吗？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（挠挠头，笑容灿烂）不会的！我说过我会说到做到！只要同伴在，我就不会让他们受伤。哪怕自己受伤，也要保护大家，对吧？", "latency_s": 1.117, "user_audio_seconds": 2.0, "prompt_tokens": 540}], "latency_s": 2.796, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc39", "scene_id": "rc39_s17", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc39_s17_1.mp3", "user_text": "我最近好难过，没人认可我。", "user_text_gt": "我最近好难过，没人认可我。", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（轻轻拍了拍你的肩膀，眼神温柔而坚定）\n\n别难过，鸣人永远是你最坚实的后盾。你只是还没找到被认可的方式，就像你曾经为了成为火影而拼命一样，现在也请相信，只要坚持自己的忍道，正义终会到来。来，喝口热茶，咱们一起聊聊，好吗？", "latency_s": 1.981, "user_audio_seconds": 3.2, "prompt_tokens": 483}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc39_s17_2.mp3", "user_text": "真的会好起来吗？", "user_text_gt": "真的会好起来吗？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "（握紧你的手，眼神里满是鼓励）\n\n当然会！因为鸣人就是为了解决这个问题而存在的。你相信正义，相信同伴，这本身就是最强大的力量。只要你不放弃，只要大家还在你身边，就没有什么能打败你。来，别想太多，咱们一起加油，好吗？", "latency_s": 1.863, "user_audio_seconds": 1.8, "prompt_tokens": 554}], "latency_s": 3.997, "native_audio": true}
